  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The in-game camera has a toggle under Behavior called \"Auto Level\" that locks the camera so it can only rotate on the vertical axis. With \"Auto Level\" on you can't tilt the camera down to look at the floor. I don't know if this is intended behavior, but it seems like a pretty useless feature to me as it is right now.\nThe \"Auto Level\" feature should only lock the rotation so that you don't take a picture with a canted angle (prevent rotation on the forward axis)",
